Rencana 30-60-90 hari\",\"Template mini design system\",\"Kursus Figma & prototyping\",\"Panduan uji kegunaan cepat\"],\"recommendation_id\":null}', 'gpt-5', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'success', '2026-05-05 00:35:05', '2026-05-05 00:35:05'),
